                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "indie FPS set in World War I in the Middle East, where you play a campaign inspired by the Arab Uprising and must also survive the harsh desert conditions.\n\n✅Survival system tracking temperature, dehydration, and fatigue\n\n❌Terrible graphics\n❌Very poor optimization, even though I have a good computer\n❌Very poor weapon animations no decent reloading or shooting animations\n❌Empty world, large maps, but little content and little to do\n❌This game should be free!\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [b] Terrible [/b], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike] , [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for short games, retro indie simulator games and similar)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url] \n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.I'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
